-Do it.
-Come on.

1123
00:53:13,569 --> 00:53:16,238
The one and only, Professor…

1124
00:53:18,866 --> 00:53:21,410
-[Tarantula] Wolf! Do it.
-Professor…

1125
00:53:23,245 --> 00:53:24,913
Um…

1126
00:53:27,040 --> 00:53:29,042
Professor Marmalade!

1127
00:53:29,126 --> 00:53:30,627
[guests cheering]

1128
00:53:31,795 --> 00:53:33,630
Chief, may I do the honors?

1129
